    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We at Felicity Fox are delighted to present to the market this 4 bedroom mid terrace Victorian house which has been upgraded and well maintained by the current owner to provide a marvellous family home complete with sunny south east rear garden and a large garage exiting onto Chelmsford Lane.\r\n\r\nOn entering the house you are greeted with a very fine entrance hall with marble tiled floor and two elegant reception rooms located to the left. The hallway leads to a large family kitchen with a conservatory and a door leading to the rear garden. A guest WC completes the accommodation downstairs. Upstairs, on the first floor return, is the main bathroom and a second bathroom. There is also a double bedroom. On the first floor are three double bedrooms. To the rear is a large south east facing garden with a large garage opening onto Chelmsford Lane. Parking is on street to the front with an EV charge point close by.\r\n\r\nChelmsford Road enjoys an exceptionally convenient location in Ranelagh being in between the main shopping thoroughfare and Ballsbridge. A range of amenities are within striking distance including many of Dublin’s best restaurants, boutiques, delicatessens and coffee houses located in Ranelagh Village. St Stephen’s Green and Trinity College are a 15 to 20 minute stroll. The area is served by Dublin Bus while the Luas green line at Ranelagh station is a short walk away. An EV charging point is located a few yards away from the front door of the house. Transport to Dublin Airport is provided by Aircoach with a stop located close by. Ranelagh is close to a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall     8.02m x 1.91m\r\nTiled floor. Ceiling coving. Ceiling rose. Dado rail.\r\n\r\nGuest WC     1.81m x 0.75m\r\nTiled floor. WC. Wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nLiving room     4.06m x 3.89m\r\nPolished timber floor. Ceiling coving. Ceiling rose. Fireplace with marble surround and electric fire inset. Built-in storage. Window shutters.\r\n\r\nDining room     3.91m x 3.65m\r\nCarpet floor. Ceiling coving. Ceiling rose. Fireplace with ornate surround. Window shutters.\r\n\r\nKitchen     7.07m x 2.97\r\nTiled floor. Range of wall and floor units. Integrated appliances including oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher and fridge freezer. Freestanding washing machine and tumble dryer. Door to rear garden. Opening to \r\n\r\nConservatory     3.00m x 1.85m\r\nTiled floor. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nFirst floor return\r\n\r\nLanding     2.80m x 0.98m\r\nCarpet floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4     3.20m x 2.94m\r\nCarpet floor. Recessed lighting. Access to attic.\r\n\r\nBathroom     2.48m x 2.01m\r\nTiled floor. Part tiled walls. WC. Wash hand basin. Bath with shower overhead. Wall mounted mirror.\r\n\r\nShower room     1.87m x 1.18m\r\nTiled floor. Part tiled walls. Recessed lighting. WC. Wash hand basin. Shower enclosure with Mira electric shower. Heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nLanding     1.84m x 1.36m\r\nCarpet floor. Recessed lighting. Access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1     3.95m x 3.72m\r\nPolished timber floor. Ceiling coving. Fireplace. Window shutters.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2     4.05m x 2.90m\r\nCarpet floor. Ceiling coving. Window shutters. Access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3     3.24m x 2.92m\r\nCarpet floor. Ceiling coving. Window shutters.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nRear garden     5.68m x 4.15m plus 7.11m x 2.30m\r\nSouth east facing. Mature trees and shrubbery. Outside tap. Door to\r\n\r\nGarage     5.90m (widest) x 5.28 (widest)\r\nExiting onto Chelmsford Lane. Automatic door.\r\n\r\nOn street car parking to front. EV charge point on Chelmsford Road."
      },
      {
