        "Content": "4 Bedroom mid terrace Victorian house\r\nMaintained to a high standard throughout\r\nHigh ceilings throughout\r\nOrnate plasterwork\r\nTimber frame sash windows\r\nWindow shutters throughout\r\nSouth east facing rear garden\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nFloor area approximately 137sqm/ 1,474qft\r\nLarge garage with automatic door exiting onto Chelmsford Lane\r\nEV charging point on Chelmsford Road\r\nClose to the LUAS green line at Ranelagh station\r\nServed by Aircoach providing transport to Dublin Airport\r\nA short walk to Ranelagh Village and Ballsbridge"
